## 4. Design map (position plant, same 1:5 input)

Feasible (lag ≤ 50 ms and ≥ 30 % 15–25 Hz reduction): 7 of 56: f_c 20 Hz / Kp 2, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 4, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 6, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 8, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 12, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 16, f_c 20 Hz / Kp 20.
Shipped: f_c 5.0 Hz, Kp 8.0. Reduction here is of the simulated tool velocity (the command path through the plant), not measured arm vibration (folder 01).

